#. module: dropshipping
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dropshipping.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Automated Sales Funnels</strong> – Maximize conversions with the "
"<strong>Marketing Automation App</strong>, guiding potential buyers "
"seamlessly from interest to purchase."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຂະບວນການຂາຍແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ</strong> – ເພີ່ມຍອດຂາຍສູງສຸດດ້ວຍ <strong>ແອັບລະບົບການ"
"ຕະຫຼາດອັດຕະໂນມັດ (Marketing Automation)</strong>, ນຳພາຜູ້ຊື້ທີ່ມີທ່າແຮງ ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມສົນໃຈໄປຈົນຮ"
"ອດການສັ່ງຊື້ຢ່າງສະດວກສະບາຍ."

#. module: dropshipping
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dropshipping.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Email Campaigns That Convert</strong> – Use the <strong>Email "
"Marketing App</strong> to send newsletters, promotions, and updates straight "
"to your customers' inboxes."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແຄມເປນອີເມວທີ່ສ້າງຍອດຂາຍ</strong> – ນຳໃຊ້ <strong>ແອັບການຕະຫຼາດຜ່ານອີເມວ "
"(Email Marketing)</strong> ເພື່ອສົ່ງຈົດໝາຍຂ່າວ, ໂປຣໂມຊັນ ແລະ ຂ່າວສານໃໝ່ໆ ສົ່ງກົງເຖິງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວ"
"າມຂອງລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: dropshipping
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dropshipping.ir_ui_view_1661
msgid ""
"<strong>Find the perfect case for your phone – durable, stylish, and built "
"for everyday life.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຊອກຫາກາບໂທລະສັບທີ່ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບທ່ານ – ທົນທານ, ທັນສະໄໝ ແລະ ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອການໃຊ້ງ"
"ານປະຈຳວັນ.</strong>"

#. module: dropshipping
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dropshipping.ir_ui_view_1661
msgid "<strong>Japanese collection</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ຄໍເລັກຊັນຍີ່ປຸ່ນ</strong>"

#. module: dropshipping
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dropshipping.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>One-Click Confirmation:</strong> Review and confirm purchase orders "
"instantly."
msgstr "<strong>ຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍຄລິກດຽວ:</strong> ກວດສອບ ແລະ ຢືນຢັນໃບສັ່ງຊື້ໄດ້ທັນທີ."

#. module: dropshipping
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dropshipping.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Seamless Supplier Communication:</strong> Send orders to your "
"supplier in just one click, ensuring smooth and timely fulfillment."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຕິດຕໍ່ສື່ສານກັບຜູ້ສະໜອງໄດ້ສະດວກ:</strong> ສົ່ງໃບສັ່ງຊື້ໃຫ້ຜູ້ສະໜອງຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ພາຍໃນຄລິກດຽວ, "
"ຮັບປະກັນການຈັດສົ່ງສິນຄ້າທີ່ລາບລື່ນ ແລະ ທັນເວລາ."

#. module: dropshipping
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dropshipping.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Social Media Made Simple</strong> – Schedule and manage posts "
"effortlessly with the <strong>Social Marketing App</strong> to keep your "
"audience engaged."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຈັດການສື່ສັງຄົມອອນລາຍໄດ້ງ່າຍດາຍ</strong> – ກຳນົດເວລາ ແລະ ຈັດການໂພສໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍດ້"
"ວຍ <strong>ແອັບການຕະຫຼາດສື່ສັງຄົມ (Social Marketing)</strong> ເພື່ອດຶງດູດກຸ່ມເປົ້າໝາຍຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່"
"ອງ."

